      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.16,
      "end_seconds": 12.58,
      "duration_seconds": 5.42,
      "text": "Not at all, please sit. What seems to to be wrong?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.81,
      "end_seconds": 17.53,
      "duration_seconds": 3.72,
      "text": "it's a lump in my left breast, mostly"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.58,
      "end_seconds": 22.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "what's the the timeline, when did it begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 23.19,
      "end_seconds": 31.4,
      "duration_seconds": 8.21,
      "text": "I, I'd say about a month. Actually, um, no, closer to two months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 32.11,
      "end_seconds": 36.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "Let me ask about allergies, anything at all?"
