    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 112.83,
      "end_seconds": 115.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "I've had acid reflux, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 117.11,
      "end_seconds": 121.78,
      "duration_seconds": 4.67,
      "text": "And what about nipple discharge, weight loss or skin dimpling?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 123.38,
      "end_seconds": 129.69,
      "duration_seconds": 6.31,
      "text": "No nipple discharge, weight loss or skin dimpling, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 131.41,
      "end_seconds": 134.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "How are your joints, any aches elsewhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 135.72,
      "end_seconds": 138.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.32,
      "text": "No, joints are fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.93,
      "end_seconds": 142.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "Any breathing difficulties apart from this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 144.27,
      "end_seconds": 146.13,
      "duration_seconds": 1.86,
      "text": "No problems with breathing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.96,
      "end_seconds": 160.49,
      "duration_seconds": 4.53,
      "text": "Can I check a few measurements before we carry on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 170.59,
      "end_seconds": 173.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "That's it, just a little longer..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.4,
      "end_seconds": 201.84,
      "duration_seconds": 7.44,
      "text": "Okay: BP is 124 over 79, respiratory rate 14, pulse is 86 beats a minute."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 203.22,
      "end_seconds": 207.61,
      "duration_seconds": 4.39,
      "text": "Let me look at the area, I'll be gentle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 208.71,
      "end_seconds": 211.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "I'll listen to to your chest now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 225.32,
      "end_seconds": 235.49,
      "duration_seconds": 10.17,
      "text": "there is a firm, mobile, round lump about two centimetres in the upper outer part and no lumps under the arm"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 248.19,
      "end_seconds": 249.59,
      "duration_seconds": 1.4,
      "text": "Fine by me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 253.26,
      "end_seconds": 270.11,
      "duration_seconds": 16.85,
      "text": "you can sit up now so, based on the history and the examination, it's hard to say a breast lump needing triple assessment is one possibility and a cyst another, and I'd rather not commit yet"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 271.59,
      "end_seconds": 273.75,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "Is it dangerous, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 275.78,
      "end_seconds": 300.21,
      "duration_seconds": 24.43,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's a breast lump needing triple assessment, and we'll know more once the a needle biopsy is back. I'm sending you for a needle biopsy because of breast lump. This does not mean cancer, but we do arrange a specialist one-stop clinic to be sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 300.76,
      "end_seconds": 307.37,
      "duration_seconds": 6.61,
      "text": "mm, okay. I'll also refer you to the breast clinic. See me again after the clinic"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 312.69,
      "end_seconds": 313.39,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 314.01,
      "end_seconds": 318.17,
      "duration_seconds": 4.16,
      "text": "So, anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 318.88,
      "end_seconds": 320.58,
      "duration_seconds": 1.7,
      "text": "that's clear, thanks"
